  r"""(a) $v=\left(\frac2{\sqrt{17}},\frac{-2}{\sqrt{17}},\frac3{\sqrt{17}}\right)$ có $\|v\|=\sqrt{\frac4{17}+\frac4{17}+\frac9{17}}=\sqrt{\frac{17}{17}}=1$: vectơ đơn vị. (b) $v=(0,-2,1,4,-2)\in\mathbb R^5$ có $\|v\|=\sqrt{0+4+1+16+4}=\sqrt{25}=5$.""", 2,
